const content="<article data-editorial-version=\"3\" class=\"sn-page\"><div class=\"sn-read\"><a href=\"/supporters/\">← Featured sponsors</a><p class=\"sn-kicker\">Marine Diesel Engine · Sponsor feature</p><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/mainstay-sailing/logo.svg\" alt=\"Mainstay Sailing logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\"><h1>Mainstay Sailing: learn to sail in the Whitsundays</h1><p class=\"sn-intro\">Mainstay Sailing offers hands-on RYA courses and private tuition from Airlie Beach. For owners who want to develop their sailing ability, the business provides dedicated time aboard with instruction, from Competent Crew through Yachtmaster.</p><img class=\"sn-hero\" src=\"/images/supporters/mainstay-sailing/course.webp\" alt=\"Mainstay Sailing yacht under sail beside a green Whitsundays island\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\"><section><h2>Put the boat to use with stronger skills</h2><p>Taking care of the engine helps prepare a yacht for its trips. Sailing tuition prepares the people who operate it. Mainstay&#x27;s programme, based at Coral Sea Marina, gives students different levels to investigate according to their experience.</p><p>We like the practical purpose of the booking. The Whitsundays are an attractive location, but a course is about learning aboard a yacht. Focused instruction gives skills attention that an owner may not find while juggling maintenance and normal outings.</p></section><section><h2>Private tuition for particular needs</h2><p>One-to-one training is available for people who want individual attention or have specific goals. A sailor may be comfortable with many jobs on their own vessel and still want help with another part of operating it.</p><p>That flexibility is a reason we feature Mainstay. The conversation can start with the student&#x27;s experience and priorities, helping them choose between a course pathway and a private format.</p></section><section><h2>Sailing experiences as well as courses</h2><p>Mainstay also offers a Couples Sailing Escape for customers wanting a private trip together. It is a separate service from formal training and gives another reason to sail with the business.</p><p>For readers looking after their boats, Mainstay provides an investment in the sailing itself. Practical teaching and individual tuition can help owners make more of the vessel they maintain, with the Whitsundays adding to the enjoyment of the time aboard.</p></section><div class=\"sn-contact\"><a href=\"https://www.mainstaysailing.com.au/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Sail with Mainstay ↗</a><a href=\"/supporters/\">More featured sponsors</a></div></div></article><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Article\", \"headline\": \"Mainstay Sailing: learn to sail in the Whitsundays\", \"description\": \"Learn to sail in the Whitsundays with Mainstay Sailing, offering practical RYA courses and private tuition from Coral Sea Marina in Airlie Beach.\", \"image\": \"https://marinedieselengine.com.au/images/supporters/mainstay-sailing/course.webp\", \"author\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Marine Diesel Engine\"}, \"dateModified\": \"2026-11-05\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": \"https://marinedieselengine.com.au/supporters/mainstay-sailing/\"}</script>";
